      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:0",
          "text": "Aim Dark Binding down the lane at the enemy carry, but stand so a minion won't be the first target hit. It stops at the first enemy it touches.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-Q", "start": 4, "end": 16 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.03
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:1",
          "text": "Follow a landed Dark Binding with Tormented Shadow on the rooted enemy, since they can't step out of it.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-Q", "start": 16, "end": 28 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-W", "start": 34, "end": 50 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "rooted", "start": 58, "end": 64 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.09
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:2",
          "text": "Use Tormented Shadow on enemies who are low on Health; it hurts them more the lower they are, so it punishes anyone trying to stay in lane.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-W", "start": 4, "end": 20 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.02
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:3",
          "text": "Save Black Shield for the enemy's key disable on you or your carry. It blocks the disable, so don't spend it on poke.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-E", "start": 5, "end": 17 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.04
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:4",
          "text": "Put Black Shield on yourself when you need to walk up and land Dark Binding without being stopped by a stun.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-E", "start": 4, "end": 16 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-Q", "start": 63, "end": 75 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.15
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:5",
          "text": "At level 6, start Soul Shackles when several enemies are close. They are stunned if they stay chained, so they must run away.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Morgana-R", "start": 18, "end": 31 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.11
        },
        {
          "id": "support:Morgana:general:6",
          "text": "Hit enemy champions with your abilities to heal through Soul Siphon, which also shortens Tormented Shadow's cooldown.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
